answer.worked:
$$\begin{align*}
N &= a - bt \\
bt &= a - N \\
t &= \frac{a - N}{b}
\end{align*}$$

$$\begin{align*}
\text{Number of people remaining} (N) &= 60000 - 10000 = 50000 \\
t &= \frac{60000 - 50000}{2000} \\
&= \frac{10000}{2000} \\
&= 5 \text{ minutes}
\end{align*}$$

